; heat-witness-long: 200M dispatches of one spin — long enough to cross
; the 64M live-pulse boundary twice. Run it in the background and read
; .fkwu-heat mid-flight: at ~1.4s the file already says 67108864 spin
; (exactly 2^26 — the first pulse), and after exit 200000001 spin. The
; six-hour interpreted freeze class is caught in its first two seconds.
(defn spin (n) (if (le n 0) 0 (spin (sub n 1))))
(spin 200000000)
